 #006699;" rel=3D"noopener">no longer fit for purpose</a>, a review led by =
Sir Stephen Timms, the disability minister, will recommend this week.</p><p=
 style=3D"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:21px">&nbsp;</p><p=20
style=3D"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:27px"><strong>How will=
 it work?</strong> Claimants with the most severe and well-evidenced condit=
ions should undergo a fast-track process <a href=3D"https://link.thetimes.c=
om/click/48557567.442378/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudGhldGltZXMuY29tL3VrL3BvbGl0aWNzL2=
